<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-CHINA BANKING SAYS SIX-MTH NET UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-CHINA BANKING SAYS SIX-MTH NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			 (in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Revenues (billion)	 2.938 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Net income		     513 vs 425</p>
<p>Note: Full name China Banking Corp. The bank said expenses reached 2.359 billion pesos. Deposit liabilities went up 62.75 percent to 39.177 billion pesos during the period.</p>
